  "summary": "I added pause to the game: P toggles it, and `window.__TASK_STATE__` now includes `paused: boolean`. Typecheck passes. I didn't run the game or press P in a browser, so this is untested at runtime.\n\n- **While paused:** the slab stops, falling debris freezes, and Space and canvas clicks do nothing. A click does not restart either.\n- **HUD:** a yellow \"Paused\" label shows beside the status while paused. I also added \"P: pause\" to the controls hint.\n- **P outside play:** P only works while the status is `playing`, so it does nothing after a win or loss.\n- **Restart:** R restarts at any time and clears the pause.\n\nThe changes are in `src/main.ts` and `index.html`."
